					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is the spiritual sequel to my other tale, <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/who-am-i">Who Am I?</a>.</p> <p>Thanks to Roget, Sirens, MrWrong, Modern_Erasmus, and Zyn for reading this before I posted.</p> <p>This story is a flash-fiction style exploration of what 173 is, where it came from, and what it feels. I hope you enjoy.</p> 
				 	]]>
